---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

import logo from "../assets/img/logo.svg";
import avatarKonstance from "../assets/img/konstance_avatar.svg";
import avatarMatthis from "../assets/img/matthis_avatar.svg";
import avatarMatias from "../assets/img/matias_avatar.svg";
---

<Layout
	title="Odysignes - À propos"
	description="Découvrez la mission, l'équipe et l'approche d'Odysignes."
>
	<div class="bg-white">
		<Header logoSrc={logo.src} />

		<main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-16 pt-8 sm:px-6">
			<section class="text-center">
				<div class="mx-auto flex h-32 w-32 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-blue bg-white shadow-soft sm:h-36 sm:w-36">
					<img
						src={logo.src}
						alt="Logo Odysignes"
						class="h-20 w-20 sm:h-24 sm:w-24"
					/>
				</div>
				<h1 class="mt-6 font-title text-4xl text-blue sm:text-5xl">
					ODYSIGNES
				</h1>
				<p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-sm text-base leading-7 text-black/80 sm:max-w-xl sm:text-lg">
					L'application qui révolutionne l'apprentissage de la langue des
					signes française
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="mt-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-blue px-5 py-6 text-white shadow-soft sm:px-7 sm:py-7">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
					<span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/25 bg-white/10">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" class="h-7 w-7 text-white" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<circle cx="24" cy="24" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.95" />
							<circle cx="24" cy="24" r="4" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.9" />
							<circle cx="24" cy="24" r="18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.25" />
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2 class="font-title text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Notre mission</h2>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-white/95 sm:text-base">
					Rendre l'apprentissage de la langue des signes française accessible,
					ludique et motivant pour tous. Nous croyons que chacun devrait
					pouvoir communiquer sans barrières. Inspirés par Duolingo et
					adaptés aux besoins spécifiques de l'apprentissage visuel, nous
					combinons narration, gamification et pédagogie pour créer une
					expérience unique.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="mt-10">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
					<span class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue/15 text-blue shadow-soft">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" class="h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M10 18c0-2.2 1.8-4 4-4h20c2.2 0 4 1.8 4 4v12c0 2.2-1.8 4-4 4H24l-6.5 5v-5H14c-2.2 0-4-1.8-4-4V18Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" />
							<path d="M17 21h14M17 27h9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2 class="font-title text-3xl text-blue sm:text-4xl">L'équipe</h2>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
					<article class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-black/5 bg-white px-4 py-5 text-center shadow-soft sm:px-5">
						<img src={avatarKonstance.src} alt="Konstance" class="mx-auto h-16 w-16 rounded-full object-cover sm:h-20 sm:w-20" loading="lazy" />
						<p class="mt-4 font-title text-[0.85rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-black sm:text-base">Konstance</p>
						<p class="text-[0.72rem] text-black/55 sm:text-sm">Communication</p>
						<p class="mt-3 text-[0.72rem] leading-5 text-black/70 sm:text-sm">
							Passionnée par le partage et l'image, elle fait rayonner l'univers d'Odysignes à travers des contenus créatifs et engageants.
						</p>
					</article>

					<article class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-black/5 bg-white px-4 py-5 text-center shadow-soft sm:px-5">
						<img src={avatarMatthis.src} alt="Matthis" class="mx-auto h-16 w-16 rounded-full object-cover sm:h-20 sm:w-20" loading="lazy" />
						<p class="mt-4 font-title text-[0.85rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-black sm:text-base">Matthis</p>
						<p class="text-[0.72rem] text-black/55 sm:text-sm">Développement technique</p>
						<p class="mt-3 text-[0.72rem] leading-5 text-black/70 sm:text-sm">
							Garant de la fluidité et de la technique, il veille à une plateforme interactive, sûre et agréable à utiliser.
						</p>
					</article>

					<article class="rounded-[1.6rem] border border-black/5 bg-white px-4 py-5 text-center shadow-soft sm:px-5">
						<img src={avatarMatias.src} alt="Matias" class="mx-auto h-16 w-16 rounded-full object-cover sm:h-20 sm:w-20" loading="lazy" />
						<p class="mt-4 font-title text-[0.85rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-black sm:text-base">Matias</p>
						<p class="text-[0.72rem] text-black/55 sm:text-sm">Design</p>
						<p class="mt-3 text-[0.72rem] leading-5 text-black/70 sm:text-sm">
							Il imagine une interface colorée et claire, pensée pour rendre la langue des signes instinctive et ludique.
						</p>
					</article>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section class="mt-12 rounded-[2rem] bg-blue px-5 py-6 text-white shadow-soft sm:px-7 sm:py-7">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
					<span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/25 bg-white/10">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" class="h-7 w-7 text-white" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M12 15.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 14.5 13h19A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 36 15.5v17A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 33.5 35h-19A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 32.5v-17Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" />
							<path d="M18 13v22M30 13v22M12 21h24M12 29h24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
						</svg>
					</span>
					<h2 class="font-title text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
						Ce qui nous rend unique
					</h2>
				</div>

				<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
					<div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-4 shadow-soft backdrop-blur-sm">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-blue font-title text-lg">1</span>
							<h3 class="font-title text-xl sm:text-[1.65rem]">Apprentissage narratif</h3>
						</div>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/95 sm:text-base">Des histoires immersives avec Hyo et Shiki</p>
					</div>

					<div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-4 shadow-soft backdrop-blur-sm">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-blue font-title text-lg">2</span>
							<h3 class="font-title text-xl sm:text-[1.65rem]">Gamification poussée</h3>
						</div>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/95 sm:text-base">5 types de mini-jeux pour ne jamais s'ennuyer</p>
					</div>

					<div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-4 shadow-soft backdrop-blur-sm">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-blue font-title text-lg">3</span>
							<h3 class="font-title text-xl sm:text-[1.65rem]">Leçons thématiques</h3>
						</div>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/95 sm:text-base">Apprenez par catégories du quotidien</p>
					</div>

					<div class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-4 shadow-soft backdrop-blur-sm">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
							<span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-blue font-title text-lg">4</span>
							<h3 class="font-title text-xl sm:text-[1.65rem]">Progression adaptative</h3>
						</div>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/95 sm:text-base">Avancez à votre rythme avec un système intelligent</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>

		<Footer logoSrc={logo.src} />
	</div>
</Layout>
